    "&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.2;margin-left: 1.7pt;margin-top:6pt;margin-bottom:6pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Condition 25 is to be revised to read as follows&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.2;margin-top:6pt;margin-bottom:6pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;‘No roof plant (including all external enclosures, machinery and other installations) shall be placed upon or attached to the roof or other external surfaces of the building unless otherwise approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority.’&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.2;margin-top:6pt;margin-bottom:6pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Condition 37 is to be revised to read as follows&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-d0d44a59-7fff-e07b-67cb-2853d96dfb7e&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.2;margin-top:6pt;margin-bottom:6pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Prior to the occupation of the development all buildings are to be provided with suitable Access and Facilities for Fire-Fighting in line with Requirement B5 of the Building Regulations and to the written approval of the London Fire Brigade (the Fire Authority).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;Condition 2 revision&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;Within condition&amp;nbsp;2 the relevant approved plans shall be replaced by:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Proposed Ground Floor Plan Dwg No. 684P03 Rev A Dated May 2025&lt;br&gt;Proposed First Floor Plan Dwg No. 684P04 Rev A Dated May 2025&lt;br&gt;Proposed Second Floor Plan Dwg No. 684P05 Rev A Dated May 2025&lt;br&gt;Proposed Roof Plan Dwg no. 684P06 Rev C Dated 8th Sept 2025&lt;br&gt;Site Plan Landscaping Dwg no. 684P07 Rev B Dated May 2025&lt;br&gt;Proposed Elevations 1 and 3 and Sections 2 and 3 Dwg no. 684P08 Rev A Dated 30th May 2025&lt;br&gt;Proposed Elevations 6 and 9 and Sections 8 and 9 Dwg no. 684P09 Rev B Dated 8th September 2025&lt;br&gt;Proposed Elevations 4 and 7 and Sections 4 and 5 Dwg no. 684P10 Rev A Dated 30th May 2025&lt;br&gt;Proposed Elevations 10 and 11 and Section 10 Dwg no. 684P11 Rev A Dated 30th May 2025&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;All other plans remain as approved by planning permission ref. 2009/2842 on 30th June 2020, unless otherwise amended by either a separate S96 application or S73 application.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Reason: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interests of proper planning&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;"
  ],
